        "title": "Making Humans Smile",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "Brooklyn Product Design talk",
            "highlights": [
              "talk"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "From bringing out the best of those around us through better human treatment, to bringing joy and delight to our customers through thoughtful design decisions, this talk is about putting smiles on the faces of others, and the impacts doing so has on our world. And on the products we deliver."
          }
        ],
        "image": {
          "role": "case.screenshot",
          "src": "/images/1699982212-dlspeech.jpg"
        },
        "cta": {
          "label": "WATCH the talk",
          "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RHLOt9APtKo"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "image-fade-in",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "instant-visible"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.media-text",
      "content": {
        "title": "Low-Key Legends Ep. 2",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "Low-Key Legends podcast",
            "highlights": [
              "podcast"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A near two hour conversation with legendary podcast host Britton Stipetic about how when we begin to treat the people we work with, and the people that use the products we build, like actual human beings, amazing results will follow."
          }
        ],
        "image": {
          "role": "case.screenshot",
          "src": "/images/1694810419-spotify.jpg"
