        "body": [
          {
            "text": "Self-published book",
            "highlights": [
              "book"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "This book offers non-traditional approaches to reducing overwork and burnout, rethinking the pitch process, treating partners like humans, and many other methods to leading and managing that are focused on employee well-being."
          }
        ],
